":"flow","items":["Operations Management","HR","Finance","Vendor Management"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality"},{"type":"flow","items":["Quality Management","Patient Safety","Process Improvement"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Excel","Power BI","SQL","Healthcare KPIs"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"flow","items":["HIS/EMR Concepts","Digital Health","Healthcare Data"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"flow","items":["Communication","Coordination","Problem Solving","Documentation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Progression"},{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Primary Objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Management + healthcare fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Hospital operations + patient-flow management"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Quality + finance + healthcare analytics"}],[{"text":"Final Year"},{"text":"Operations project + hospital internship + technology"}],[{"text":"0–2 Years"},{"text":"Healthcare Operations Executive"}],[{"text":"2–5 Years"},{"text":"Senior Executive / Operations Coordinator"}],[{"text":"5–10 Years"},{"text":"Operations Manager / Hospital Administrator"}],[{"text":"10+ Years"},{"text":"Hospital Operations Head / Regional Operations Head"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For this degree-to-career combination, the strongest route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Hospital/Healthcare Management","Hospital Operations Internship","Healthcare Operations Executive","Senior Operations Executive","Operations Manager","Hospital Operations Head"]},{"type":"p","text":"The graduate should not limit the role to front-office or administrative coordination. A stronger healthcare operations professional combines patient-flow management + hospital finance + quality management + healthcare technology + process improvement + data analytics. Adding Excel, Power BI, SQL, healthcare KPIs, Lean/Six Sigma, and 